      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصهب</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a stallion [meaning a stallion
camel]) <i>had young ones such as are termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُهْب</span> [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْهَبُ</span>] <i>born to him:</i> (K:) or,
accord. to the M and L, <i>he</i> (a man) <i>had children
such as are so termed born to him.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاهِبْ</span>.

